### Jungle Pickoff Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings, Divine Glaive
- Core: Genius Wand, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when control duration matters more than early magic penetration during the first dash chain.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when shield, healing, or high-HP frontliners are keeping targets alive through the ultimate pulses.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one late-game burst combo can kill Joy after she commits Beat Energy into the backline.
- Total cost: 11980 gold

Default jungle setup for games where Joy can reach Genius Wand into Starlium Scythe and punish isolated carries with full-rhythm entries.

### Jungle Anti-Sustain (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Genius Wand, Glowing Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Winter Crown
- Core: Genius Wand, Glowing Wand, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has light crowd control and Joy needs more early kill pressure from magic penetration.; Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use while ahead when extra shield, movement, and magic power are worth more than a stasis active.; Starlium Scythe over Winter Crown when Use when Joy can weave basic attacks between dashes without being punished by instant burst.
- Total cost: 11630 gold

Safer jungle setup for sustain-heavy or tankier drafts where Glowing Wand and Divine Glaive matter more than pure pickoff damage.

### EXP Sustain Duel (EXP)

